      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "peer",
      "stage": "tcp_fsm",
      "description": "However, a sending TCP peer MUST be robust against window shrinking, which may cause the \"usable window\" (see Section 3.8.6.2.1) to become negative (MUST-34).",
